  "fullDescription": "🏋️‍♀️ 2026 Fitness & Meal Planner 🥗\nStay organized, motivated, and focused on your fitness and wellness goals all year long!\nThis all-in-one planner helps you track your workouts, meals, water intake, calories, habits, and progress for the entire 2026 year. Perfect for achieving balance in your body and mind through mindful tracking and daily motivation.\n\n📌 Key Features:\n\n📅 2026 Full Year Calendar – Easily plan your fitness journey throughout the year.\n\n💪 Daily, Weekly & Monthly Fitness Tracker – Record workouts, energy levels, and progress.\n\n🥗 Meal Planner & Grocery List – Organize healthy meals and grocery essentials.\n\n⚖️ Weight & Body Measurement Tracker – Track your weight loss and fitness transformation.\n\n💧 Water & Supplements Tracker – Keep up with hydration and vitamin intake.\n\n🔥 12-Week, 30-Day & 52-Week Challenges – Stay inspired with built-in fitness challenges.\n\n🏃 Running & Steps Log – Monitor daily steps, distance, and activity levels.\n\n📈 Macro & Calorie Tracker – Balance your protein, carbs, fats, and calories effectively.\n\n📝 Recipe Cards & Health Diary – Record healthy recipes, meals, and reflections.\n\n🌟 Vision Board & Goal Setting Pages – Set clear goals and visualize your success.\n\nFiles include:\n\n✨ Editable Canva Link\nAccess and customize your design easily.\n\n📄 High-quality, upload-ready PDF files\nSuitable for professional printing.\n\n🖼️ JPG files\nSharp, clear images for versatile use.\n\n📄 PDF files\nEasily downloadable and printable.\n\n🎨 62 Pages\nA variety of beautiful design page.\n\n📏 Page Size: 6×9 inches\nStandard for easy printing.\n\n🚫 Bleed-free\nDesigned with safe printing margins.\n\n🔍 300 DPI\nHigh-resolution for high-quality printing.\n\n{Important Note}\n\n🙏 Thank you for visiting!\nThank you for viewing my product. If you like it, don’t forget to visit my store to explore more! 🌟",
